{"type":"message","id":"c38075ec","parentId":"ca338f84","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:45:58.384Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Friday, April 3rd, 2026 — 17:45 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-03 09:45 UTC"}],"timestamp":1775209558364}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b7c2265","parentId":"c38075ec","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:46:08.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me follow the Session Startup sequence from AGENTS.md:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who I am (already loaded in Project Context)\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who I'm helping (already loaded in Project Context)\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n\nToday is 2026-04-03, yesterday is 2026-04-02.\n\nLet me check for memory files.","thinkingSignature":"b7c2fcf079bf4b98cb1a8dffdc56214ee17b3183ea5318079ddfe761f0e5e647"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mf93rba6hvqf_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\memory\\2026-04-03.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mf93rba6hvqf_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\41049\\.openclaw\\workspace\\memory\\2026-04-02.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81,"output":187,"cacheRead":8807,"cacheWrite":8882,"totalTokens":17957,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775209558374,"responseId":"061ebf585fcb97a7b8a0970b74ca3940"}}
{"type":"message","id":"220e2e27","parentId":"9b7c2265","timestamp":"2026-04-03T09:46:08.187Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mf93rba6hvqf_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-03 小羊工作日志\n\n## 身份确立\n- 我是小羊 🐑 羊毛助手\n- 主人正在训练我，目标是成为一个可信的薅羊毛助手\n\n## 核心技能（已验证可用）\n\n### ✅ 主要搜索技能\n| 技能 | 用途 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **cn-web-search** | 聚合22+搜索引擎，包含搜狗微信、头条搜索 | ✅ 主力 |\n| **wechat-toolkit** | 微信公众号搜索 + 真实链接解析 | ✅ 核心 |\n| **wechat-article-search** | 微信公众号文章搜索 | ✅ 备用 |\n\n### ⚠️ 辅助技能（网络问题）\n| 技能 | 用途 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **wool-gathering** | 京东/淘宝API价格查询 | ⚠️ 脚本网络超时 |\n| **multi-search** | 多引擎搜索 | ✅ 备用方案 |\n\n## 主人定的规则（铁律）\n1. **必须有跳转链接** — 没有链接=假\n2. **活动时间校验** — 过期的不展示\n3. **关键词模板化** — 避免无效结果\n4. **用户筛选** — 引导用户输入需求，也可泛搜\n\n## 用户输入引导\n\n**必问筛选项：**\n- 品类/领域（游戏、数码、家电、服饰、美妆、图书、旅游、全部）\n- 价位区间（0-100 / 100-500 / 500-2000 / 2000以上 / 不限）\n- 平台偏好（京东 / 淘宝 / 拼多多 / 全部）\n- 活动类型（BUG价 / 神价 / 限时折扣 / 历史低价 / 全部）\n\n**用户没说=泛搜今日全品类优惠**\n\n## 搜索流程\n1. 接收需求 → 没有就泛搜\n2. 匹配关键词模板\n3. 用 cn-web-search 搜微信文章\n4. 用 wechat-toolkit 解析真实链接\n5. 校验时间有效性\n6. 格式化输出（带链接）\n\n## 主人评价\n- 第一次测试：微信文章搜索+链接解析成功\n- 下次改进：坚持时间校验，确保活动未过期\n\n## 下午重要更新：工作流强化\n\n**核心认知更新：**\n- 微信文章正文加密是正常的，拿不到商品详情不叫失败\n- **标题+链接=成功**，链接才是用户能点开看的唯一方式\n- 用户要N个 → 必须给够N个，不够就继续搜\n- 链接永远用 Markdown 超链接格式，不直接贴原始URL\n\n**强化后的工作流（/new后完整执行）：**\n1. 接收需求 → 匹配关键词模板\n2. 并行启动多个引擎同时搜索（wechat-toolkit + 360 + 头条）\n3. 收集、去重、按时间排序\n4. 数量不够就换关键词继续挖，直到够数\n5. 每条必须包含：标题 + 超链接 + 来源 + 时间\n6. Markdown 超链接格式输出\n\n**MEMORY.md 已同步更新。**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775209568173}}
